      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " operations as well, if you want 0.5 ULP accuracy you need to do *everything* in full precision",
      "path": "doc",
      "range": [
        2846,
        2944
      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " and round *exactly once, at the end*, by considering all truncated bits at once.",
